{
 "uid": "utm-obs-05-uas",
 "title": "05 - UAS Zones & Airspace",
 "description": "**Purpose:** product-oriented view of ED-269 airspace geozones held in `uas_9.0.0`.\n\n**Data source:** Elasticsearch `core-es7` (utm-core), index `uas_9.0.0`, time field `submitTime`.\n\n**IMPORTANT:** these records are **airspace zones, not drones**. Do not read the document count as a drone or operator count.\n\n**Document count caveat:** `_cat/indices` reports ~504 for this index because `uasZone.geometry` and `laraAirspaceProperties.reservations` are nested types. The business-level count from `_count` is **168**. All panels here aggregate parent documents.\n\n**Data freshness:** submitTime spans 2026-06-29 → 2026-08-04. This is a loaded dataset, not a live feed.\n\n**Known gaps:** ED-269/LARA extended properties are unpopulated; ED-269/LARA extended properties are unpopulated (shown as an explicit gap panel). Geometry IS mapped, via the uas-zones-geo derived index — see the 'How the map is produced' panel.",
 "tags": [
  "utm-observability",
  "uas",
  "airspace"
 ],
 "timezone": "browser",
