    "content": "Compare **Source Zones** with **Derived Zones** — they should be equal.\n\nIf they differ, `uas-zones-geo` is stale and the map is missing (or over-reporting) zones. Rebuild with:\n\n```\nbash uas-zones-geo-build.sh\n```\n\nThe derivation is a point-in-time copy, so drift after zone changes is expected — not a fault. It is surfaced here rather than left silent."
